// Granted/revoked by an upgrade (SpawnRadiusUpSkillAction, one .asset instance per hero) - read by
// SpawnedEntitySpawner.Spawn right after creating the entity, growing its own PhysicsCollider3D by
// this bonus. Generic rather than tied to any one hero - anything spawned through
// SpawnedEntitySpawner (SpawnEntitySkillAction's own spawns, or a projectile's SpawnEntityEffectData
// like Zara's speaker) benefits the same way.
component SpawnRadiusUpgrade
{
    FP ScaleBonus;
}
